WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.658
This visual shows the relationship between raw
values and a derived metric Sales

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:12.525
and costs are the starting measures Profit is
produced from those measures This

00:00:12.538 --> 00:00:18.185
kind of dependency is common in analytics A
dashboard may display profit margin

00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:23.922
growth or utilization but those final indicators are
usually calculated from more basic values

00:00:23.948 --> 00:00:29.726
underneath When you change the values in the
runnable example pay attention

00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:35.177
to how the resulting metric changes Also remember
that an error in a starting value

00:00:35.203 --> 00:00:41.071
can flow into every calculation that depends on it
Understanding these dependencies becomes

00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:43.992
very important when we later clean and validate data
